      "heading": "Introduction",
      "id": "P001",
      "kind": "intro",
      "text": "This is the September 2, 2026 audio overview of the impeachment trial of Vice President Sara Duterte. The day centered on Attorney Michael Wesley Poa's testimony about how the Department of Education answered audit questions concerning its 2023 confidential funds."
    },
