      "heading": "The day's principal witness",
      "id": "P002",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "The prosecution called Poa and placed him under oath. After the defense clarified that it had not stipulated to the prosecution's merits offer, the chair declared Poa a hostile witness and allowed leading, but not misleading, questions."
    },
