      "heading": "How the reply was prepared",
      "id": "P005",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "Poa said he sought an accomplishment report through Undersecretary Nolasco Mempin and drafted Dep-Ed's explanation from the material and Armed Forces certifications supplied to him. He testified that those certifications were the only evidence of success attached to the reply, but he could not truthfully say whether all of the roughly 15 million pesos in rewards related to the youth leadership summits."
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
