          "speaker_name": "Atty. Benjamin Tolosa Jr."
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "S00748",
          "start_seconds": 10679.64,
          "clock": "02:57:59",
          "speaker_name": "Atty. Benjamin Tolosa Jr."
        }
      ],
      "heading": "The prosecution's challenge",
      "id": "P006",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "Prosecutor Benjamin Tolosa Junior argued that Joint Circular twenty fifteen dash zero one required a documented chain connecting an informer, the information paid for, and a successful activity. His position was that the Armed Forces certifications did not establish that chain."
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "segment_id": "S00624",
          "start_seconds": 6273.46,
          "clock": "01:44:33",
          "speaker_name": "Atty. Sheila C. Sison"
        },
        {
