          "speaker_name": "Atty. Sheila C. Sison"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "S00682",
          "start_seconds": 6831.3,
          "clock": "01:53:51",
          "speaker_name": "Atty. Sheila C. Sison"
        }
      ],
      "heading": "The defense's answer",
      "id": "P007",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "Defense counsel Sheila Sison argued that the prosecution had mischaracterized earlier testimony from Armed Forces officers. She said their answers about whether youth summits were regular military programs did not establish that Dep-Ed had supplied no information."
    },
