      "heading": "The disputed COA meeting",
      "id": "P008",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "The prosecution treated a September 2023 meeting with the Commission on Audit as evidence that Poa had become involved before the A O M and characterized the request for an audit query as an attempt to use a less formal step. Poa described the meeting as a discussion about required supporting documents and an audit-query proposal that C O A rejected in favor of an A O M. The defense objected that the record showed a request for an audit query, not a request to prevent an A O M."
    },
