      "heading": "The credit notice",
      "id": "P009",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "On cross-examination, the defense emphasized C O A's August 8, 2024 credit notice. Poa said it covered the first and second quarters only and that, as far as he knew, C O A had not reopened it or issued notices of suspension or disallowance for the periods discussed. The prosecution stressed that the notice did not cover the third quarter and that the period for possible review had not expired."
    },
