      "heading": "Questions from senator-judges",
      "id": "P010",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "Senator Francis Pangilinan asked whether Dep-Ed had the vault contemplated by the joint circular and whether Poa checked for one while preparing the reply. Senator Joel Villanueva asked what factual basis connected the paid information to the activities described in the certifications. Senate President Sherwin Gatchalian asked why the written reply used definite language when Poa later described the connection as a theory."
    },
