      "heading": "A question of compliance",
      "id": "P011",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "Senator Alan Peter Cayetano distinguished an allegation of theft from a dispute over compliance with the joint circular. He asked whether one special disbursing officer could practically serve a nationwide school system and whether routing funds through a project or security officer would itself be improper."
    },
