      "heading": "Future witnesses",
      "id": "P014",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "The chair ordered subpoenas for Edward Fajarda, Marisa Grande, Police Major Jovelin Magay, Attorney Sunshine Chary Fajarda, and Bresilo Sabaldan for the September 7 through 9 trial dates, while preserving preparation time for the defense if needed. Edward Fajarda was excused for September 7 because of his health, another medical assessment was directed, and a written stipulation proposal remained open for defense comment."
