      "heading": "What comes next",
      "id": "P015",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "The prosecution's evidence-in-chief remained underway, and the chair said it would assess future witness offers for relevance and necessity. The court adjourned until September 7, 2026, at 10 in the morning."
